@startuml Order Processing Sequence
title Order Processing Workflow - Comprehensive Sequence Diagram

actor Client
participant "OrderRestServer" as REST
participant "OrderRepository" as OrderRepo
participant "FundRepository" as FundRepo
participant "AccountRepository" as AcctRepo
participant "OrderScheduler" as Scheduler
participant "OrderStateMachine" as StateMachine
participant "OrderManager" as Manager
participant "BatchoutScheduler" as BatchScheduler
participant "BulkOrderRepository" as BulkOrderRepo
participant "BulkOrderMappingRepository" as MapRepo
participant "OrderProjectionListener" as Listener
participant "ProjectionStore" as Store

autonumber

Client ->> REST: POST /orders/plan (Order details)
activate REST
REST ->> OrderRepo: save(Order with PLANNED status)
activate OrderRepo
OrderRepo ->> OrderRepo: persist to database
deactivate OrderRepo
note over REST, Listener
  If projection listener configured
end note
REST ->> Listener: onOrderPlanned(order, fund)
activate Listener
Listener ->> Store: projectOrder(order, null, fund)
activate Store
Store ->> Store: create OrderView (denormalized)
deactivate Store
deactivate Listener
REST -->> Client: 200 OK (Order ID)
deactivate REST

note over Scheduler, Manager
  Every 30 seconds
end note

Scheduler ->> OrderRepo: findAll() + filter(not processed)
activate OrderRepo
OrderRepo -->> Scheduler: List of pending orders
deactivate OrderRepo

Scheduler ->> Scheduler: pollAndProcessPendingOrders()
activate Scheduler

loop For each pending order
  Scheduler ->> StateMachine: process(Order)
  activate StateMachine
  
  note over StateMachine, Manager
    State transitions occur in a loop
  end note
  
  alt PLANNED status
    StateMachine ->> Manager: validate(order)
    activate Manager
    note over Manager, AcctRepo
      Validate order details
    end note
    Manager ->> FundRepo: existsByFundId(productID)
    activate FundRepo
    FundRepo -->> Manager: boolean
    deactivate FundRepo
    Manager ->> AcctRepo: existsByAccountId(accountID)
    activate AcctRepo
    AcctRepo -->> Manager: boolean
    deactivate AcctRepo
    Manager -->> StateMachine: OK
    deactivate Manager
    StateMachine ->> StateMachine: setStatus(VALIDATED)
  end
  
  alt VALIDATED status
    StateMachine ->> Manager: enrich(order)
    activate Manager
    Manager -->> StateMachine: OK
    deactivate Manager
    StateMachine ->> StateMachine: setStatus(ENRICHED)
  end
  
  alt ENRICHED status
    StateMachine ->> Manager: place(order)
    activate Manager
    Manager -->> StateMachine: OK
    deactivate Manager
    StateMachine ->> StateMachine: setStatus(PLACED)
  end
  
  StateMachine -->> Scheduler: Processed Order
  deactivate StateMachine
  
  Scheduler ->> OrderRepo: save(Processed Order)
  activate OrderRepo
  OrderRepo ->> OrderRepo: persist updated order
  deactivate OrderRepo
end

deactivate Scheduler

note over BatchScheduler, Manager
  Every 120 seconds
end note

BatchScheduler ->> OrderRepo: findAll() + filter(PLACED)
activate OrderRepo
OrderRepo -->> BatchScheduler: List of PLACED orders
deactivate OrderRepo

BatchScheduler ->> BatchScheduler: Group orders by Product & Side
BatchScheduler ->> BatchScheduler: Create BulkOrder for each group
BatchScheduler ->> BulkOrderRepo: save(BulkOrder)
activate BulkOrderRepo
BulkOrderRepo ->> BulkOrderRepo: persist BulkOrder
deactivate BulkOrderRepo

note over BatchScheduler, MapRepo
  Map individual orders to bulk order
end note
BatchScheduler ->> MapRepo: saveBulkMapping(bulkOrderID, orderIDs)
activate MapRepo
MapRepo ->> MapRepo: persist mapping
deactivate MapRepo

BatchScheduler ->> OrderRepo: updateAll(orders -> BULKED)
activate OrderRepo
OrderRepo ->> OrderRepo: update orders to BULKED
deactivate OrderRepo

note over BatchScheduler, Listener
  Update read models with bulk creation
end note
BatchScheduler ->> Listener: onBulkOrderCreated(bulkOrder, fund, orderIDs)
activate Listener
Listener ->> Store: projectBulkOrder(bulkOrder, fund, orderIDs)
activate Store
Store ->> Store: create BulkOrderView
deactivate Store
deactivate Listener

Client ->> REST: POST /orders/confirm
activate REST
REST ->> OrderRepo: findByStatus(BULKED)
activate OrderRepo
OrderRepo -->> REST: BULKED orders
deactivate OrderRepo
loop For each BULKED order
  REST ->> StateMachine: process(BulkedOrder)
  activate StateMachine
  StateMachine ->> Manager: confirm(order)
  activate Manager
  Manager -->> StateMachine: OK
  deactivate Manager
  StateMachine ->> StateMachine: setStatus(CONFIRMED)
  StateMachine -->> REST: Confirmed Order
  deactivate StateMachine
  
  REST ->> OrderRepo: save(Confirmed Order)
  activate OrderRepo
  OrderRepo ->> OrderRepo: persist confirmed order
  deactivate OrderRepo
  
  REST ->> Listener: onOrderStatusChanged(order, bulkOrder, fund)
  activate Listener
  Listener ->> Store: updateOrderView(orderID, order, fund, bulkOrder)
  activate Store
  Store ->> Store: update OrderView in store
  deactivate Store
  deactivate Listener
end
REST -->> Client: 200 OK (Confirmed)
deactivate REST

Client ->> REST: POST /orders/book
activate REST
REST ->> OrderRepo: findByStatus(CONFIRMED)
activate OrderRepo
OrderRepo -->> REST: CONFIRMED orders
deactivate OrderRepo
loop For each CONFIRMED order
  REST ->> StateMachine: processBooking(ConfirmedOrder)
  activate StateMachine
  StateMachine ->> Manager: book(order)
  activate Manager
  Manager -->> StateMachine: OK
  deactivate Manager
  StateMachine ->> StateMachine: setStatus(BOOKED)
  StateMachine -->> REST: Booked Order
  deactivate StateMachine
  
  REST ->> OrderRepo: save(Booked Order)
  activate OrderRepo
  OrderRepo ->> OrderRepo: persist booked order
  deactivate OrderRepo
  
  REST ->> Listener: onOrderStatusChanged(order, bulkOrder, fund)
  activate Listener
  Listener ->> Store: updateOrderView(orderID, order, fund, bulkOrder)
  activate Store
  Store ->> Store: update OrderView in store
  deactivate Store
  deactivate Listener
end
REST -->> Client: 200 OK (Booked)
deactivate REST

note over Client, Store
  === READ-SIDE QUERIES (CQRS) ===
  Client queries denormalized read models
end note

Client ->> REST: GET /view/orders (with optional filters)
activate REST
REST ->> Store: findOrderView(orderID) OR findOrdersByAccount(accountID) OR findOrdersByFund(fundID)
activate Store
Store -->> REST: List<OrderView>
deactivate Store
REST -->> Client: 200 OK (Flattened OrderViews)
deactivate REST

Client ->> REST: GET /view/bulk-orders (with optional filters)
activate REST
REST ->> Store: findBulkOrderView(bulkOrderID) OR findBulkOrdersByFund(fundID)
activate Store
Store -->> REST: List<BulkOrderView>
deactivate Store
REST -->> Client: 200 OK (Flattened BulkOrderViews)
deactivate REST

Client ->> REST: GET /view/dashboard
activate REST
REST ->> Store: findAllOrderViews()
activate Store
Store -->> REST: List<OrderView>
deactivate Store
REST ->> Store: findAllBulkOrderViews()
activate Store
Store -->> REST: List<BulkOrderView>
deactivate Store
note over REST
  Aggregate and compute:
  - Order counts by status
  - Bulk order counts by status
  - Summary statistics
end note
REST -->> Client: 200 OK (Dashboard with metrics)
deactivate REST

Client ->> REST: GET /view/aggregates/accounts
activate REST
REST ->> Store: findAllOrderViews()
activate Store
Store -->> REST: List<OrderView>
deactivate Store
note over REST
  Group by accountID:
  - Total amount per account
  - Total quantity per account
  - Order counts per status
end note
REST -->> Client: 200 OK (Account aggregates)
deactivate REST

Client ->> REST: GET /view/aggregates/funds
activate REST
REST ->> Store: findAllOrderViews()
activate Store
Store -->> REST: List<OrderView>
deactivate Store
note over REST
  Group by fundID:
  - Total amount per fund
  - Total quantity per fund
  - Buy/Sell side counts
end note
REST -->> Client: 200 OK (Fund aggregates)
deactivate REST

Client ->> REST: POST /view/replay
activate REST
REST ->> REST: Clear all projections
REST ->> OrderRepo: findAll()
activate OrderRepo
OrderRepo -->> REST: All orders
deactivate OrderRepo
REST ->> BulkOrderRepo: findAll()
activate BulkOrderRepo
BulkOrderRepo -->> REST: All bulk orders
deactivate BulkOrderRepo
loop For each Order and BulkOrder
  REST ->> Store: projectOrder(order, bulkOrder, fund)
  REST ->> Store: projectBulkOrder(bulkOrder, fund, mappedOrderIDs)
end
note over REST, Store
  Replay: Rebuild entire read model
  from write-side event log
end note
REST -->> Client: 200 OK (Replay complete)
deactivate REST

Client ->> REST: GET /view/stream (EventSource)
activate REST
note over REST
  Server-Sent Events (SSE)
  Real-time streaming updates
end note
REST -->> Client: 200 OK (Stream established)
note over REST, Listener
  When ProjectionListener publishes events,
  they are streamed to all connected clients
end note
deactivate REST

Client ->> REST: GET /view/ui
activate REST
REST -->> Client: 200 OK (HTML Dashboard)
note over Client, REST
  Interactive web UI with:
  - Live metrics
  - Order tables
  - Real-time updates via SSE
  - Auto-refresh on stream events
end note
deactivate REST

@enduml
